1
00:02:08,886 --> 00:02:18,270
A way far away, who shall arrive?
A way with countless troubles, who shall achieve?

2
00:02:19,038 --> 00:02:25,248
Please contact us for any inquiries: turkision@gmail.com

3
00:02:43,326 --> 00:02:44,490
Mother!

4
00:02:47,886 --> 00:02:48,990
Mother!

5
00:02:53,606 --> 00:02:56,230
-Mother!
-My Halime...

6
00:02:58,726 --> 00:03:00,620
My beautiful daughter...

7
00:03:06,566 --> 00:03:09,240
I arrived, my daughter. I am here.

8
00:03:13,206 --> 00:03:16,760
Did you get cold, my beautiful daughter? Wait...

9
00:03:17,166 --> 00:03:20,900
-Mother?
-Wait, your mother will warm you up now.

10
00:03:21,815 --> 00:03:23,040
My beautiful daughter...

11
00:03:25,606 --> 00:03:29,450
-My Halime..
-Mother...

12
00:03:29,726 --> 00:03:32,520
My beautiful daughter,
do you feel warm now?

13
00:03:33,086 --> 00:03:37,030
-Halime died, mother.
-Sleep, my daughter... Sleep.

14
00:03:37,406 --> 00:03:39,610
Mother, don't you see me?

15
00:03:40,886 --> 00:03:45,440
-Sleep, my daughter...
-Mother!

16
00:03:45,926 --> 00:03:48,030
I arrived...

17
00:03:52,446 --> 00:03:58,450
-Don't be scared, my angel...
-Halime died!

18
00:04:00,646 --> 00:04:05,960
Halime died...
Don't you die too, mother, don't die!

19
00:05:02,286 --> 00:05:06,200
Mother! Mother!

20
00:05:06,486 --> 00:05:09,570
Mother open your eyes! Mother!

21
00:05:13,166 --> 00:05:16,470
Mother! Mother! Mother!

22
00:05:20,646 --> 00:05:22,680
Mother! Halime!

23
00:05:28,753 --> 00:05:29,753
Halime...

24
00:05:38,726 --> 00:05:44,760
Brother... brother? Brother!

25
00:05:48,766 --> 00:05:54,410
It was a nightmare. It was a nightmare brother.
Drink some water.

26
00:06:01,526 --> 00:06:03,010
Drink some water.

27
00:06:05,926 --> 00:06:09,050
In the name of Allah,
the compassionate, the merciful.

28
00:06:21,566 --> 00:06:24,120
Did you see my mother Bala again?

29
00:06:25,646 --> 00:06:27,320
I miss her, my sister.

30
00:06:30,046 --> 00:06:33,920
-I missed her so much.
-I can see that, brother.

31
00:06:35,166 --> 00:06:39,320
I can see that, brother.
I can see your pain.

32
00:06:40,606 --> 00:06:45,320
I miss my mother Bala too.
And my sister...

33
00:06:46,486 --> 00:06:53,260
Halime... Whenever I hear her name,
my heart hurts, brother.

34
00:06:57,806 --> 00:07:01,600
-Brother...
-My Fatma... my sister...

35
00:07:02,686 --> 00:07:06,260
-My sister...
-But I cannot do anything...

36
00:07:28,406 --> 00:07:30,080
My Shahzade(Prince)!

37
00:07:31,686 --> 00:07:33,960
Let us train together, shall we?

38
00:07:43,366 --> 00:07:44,500
Come, Konur Bey.

39
00:07:47,166 --> 00:07:48,610
The field is yours!

40
00:08:06,246 --> 00:08:12,580
Let's go my Shahzade(Prince)!
You know what to do!

41
00:08:26,366 --> 00:08:31,320
Hit! Hit! Hit!

42
00:08:49,086 --> 00:08:52,280
My Shahzade(Prince)! Come on!

43
00:09:01,126 --> 00:09:06,960
Hit! Hit! Hit! Hit!

44
00:09:08,046 --> 00:09:10,520
What happened, my Shahzade(Prince)?

45
00:09:12,726 --> 00:09:16,840
What happened? Was it too strong?

46
00:09:42,486 --> 00:09:47,400
Control your anger. It weakens you.

47
00:09:55,566 --> 00:10:01,000
-Come on my Shahzade(Prince)!
-Come on, brother! You can defeat him!

48
00:10:02,406 --> 00:10:05,760
I am not my anger's servant...

49
00:10:12,966 --> 00:10:15,320
..I am its master!

50
00:10:16,806 --> 00:10:19,360
Come on my Shahzade!

51
00:10:32,646 --> 00:10:36,040
Experience always defeats talent.

52
00:10:40,726 --> 00:10:43,960
You're right, but...

53
00:10:45,126 --> 00:10:48,800
...precaution always defeats experience.

54
00:10:57,206 --> 00:11:02,520
It was you who told me to
always have a secret dagger, Konur Bey.

55
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,520
Yeah.

56
00:11:20,966 --> 00:11:25,000
-You've become a brave Bey, my Shahzade
-Thank you.

57
00:11:37,166 --> 00:11:39,800
My Shahzade(Prince)... Konur Bey.

58
00:11:40,926 --> 00:11:46,160
-The army came to Yenisehir for the conquest.
-Good.

59
00:12:07,246 --> 00:12:10,960
Oh Bursa..

60
00:12:16,846 --> 00:12:20,440
They trust the castles around them...

61
00:12:22,446 --> 00:12:24,840
...and they boast about themselves.

62
00:12:27,446 --> 00:12:29,640
Kite...

63
00:12:34,646 --> 00:12:35,820
Atranos...

64
00:12:38,033 --> 00:12:39,033
and...

65
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:42,399
Kestel.

66
00:12:45,366 --> 00:12:50,320
When these castles fall,
who can protect Bursa from us, Osman Bey?

67
00:12:51,406 --> 00:12:55,920
No one! And they know that.

68
00:12:57,086 --> 00:13:01,960
Therefore, they are trying to attack us
to harm our union.

69
00:13:03,046 --> 00:13:08,440
They wanted to attack Yenisehir
but they paid its price with their lives.

70
00:13:09,566 --> 00:13:13,640
Giving their lives won't be enough
to pay that price...

71
00:13:17,006 --> 00:13:22,680
...we will also take their castles.
-Sure we will.

72
00:13:35,566 --> 00:13:39,120
Whenever there is a fight,
my heart is divided into 3 pieces.

73
00:13:40,126 --> 00:13:44,960
My Orhan, my Alaeddin grew up
and they became strong Beys.

74
00:13:50,406 --> 00:13:54,840
I know that if we have one of them,
we will achieve our goal if Allah permits.

75
00:13:56,086 --> 00:14:01,040
We will. We will.

76
00:14:07,126 --> 00:14:14,400
O, Bursa... It's either you...

77
00:14:19,206 --> 00:14:20,350
...or me.

78
00:14:26,926 --> 00:14:29,720
Alps! In order!

79
00:14:40,606 --> 00:14:45,120
Praise be! Praise be!

80
00:14:49,646 --> 00:14:52,040
Our target is Kestel Castle.

81
00:14:55,126 --> 00:14:57,600
My Alps!

82
00:14:58,766 --> 00:15:01,200
-Are you ready for the fight?
-We are, my Bey!

83
00:15:02,286 --> 00:15:07,160
-What do Alps want?
-To fight!

84
00:15:10,486 --> 00:15:12,680
-What else?
-The blood of infidels!

85
00:15:13,686 --> 00:15:15,600
-What else?
-They want the innocent ones to be in peace!

86
00:15:16,646 --> 00:15:18,080
-What else?
-To be martyrs!

87
00:15:19,166 --> 00:15:24,640
O praise be to my valiants!
Praise be!

88
00:15:28,246 --> 00:15:31,400
I brought news from Konya, Boran Bey.

89
00:15:42,526 --> 00:15:43,920
Thank you, brother.

90
00:15:51,526 --> 00:15:54,360
My Bey, it's from Konya.

91
00:16:08,726 --> 00:16:11,000
No.

92
00:16:35,766 --> 00:16:37,230
Beys.

93
00:16:39,846 --> 00:16:43,800
Everyone come to the council. Now!

94
00:16:52,966 --> 00:16:56,300
Ulgen Hatun, I was looking for you.
My mother wants to see you.

95
00:16:56,446 --> 00:16:58,280
Fatma, they say a messenger came.

96
00:17:00,366 --> 00:17:02,549
Any news from Cerkutay?

97
00:17:03,567 --> 00:17:04,787
No. No, sister Ulgen.

98
00:17:07,685 --> 00:17:14,880
-The messenger came from Konya.
-It's been so long... Without him.

99
00:17:17,726 --> 00:17:22,660
But I know he's not dead.
Cerkutay would never die.

100
00:17:26,685 --> 00:17:32,960
Mother! My father is back, right?
My father is back home! He's back, right?

101
00:17:40,406 --> 00:17:45,560
-He will be back, my dear.
-When, mother?

102
00:17:47,166 --> 00:17:54,080
You keep saying he'll come back.
But he doesn't come back.

103
00:17:59,126 --> 00:18:01,720
He'll come back, my dear.

104
00:18:16,686 --> 00:18:21,680
My Beys, I'm stopping
the conquest of Kestel.

105
00:18:23,006 --> 00:18:25,600
Why are you stopping it, my Bey?

106
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:31,440
Our people need a new Sultan now.

107
00:18:36,406 --> 00:18:40,200
-How come, my Bey?
-Sultan Mesud...

108
00:18:42,566 --> 00:18:44,840
...got poisoned.

109
00:18:51,446 --> 00:18:53,680
And there is no going back.

110
00:18:55,806 --> 00:19:01,140
Oh no.
This means the horses will whinny again.

111
00:19:02,286 --> 00:19:04,730
Yes. The swords will be drawn.

112
00:19:04,730 --> 00:19:08,650
And many men will die until
the new Sultan ascends the throne, huh?

113
00:19:11,606 --> 00:19:18,280
Now tell me...
Shall we put ourselves in for the position?

114
00:19:21,166 --> 00:19:24,180
My Allah is my witness that
my heart wants it.

115
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:29,190
Well, my Bey Osman deserves
to be the head of all Turkmen.

116
00:19:30,806 --> 00:19:34,840
But we should know our place, my Bey.

117
00:19:36,686 --> 00:19:41,640
On one side, Germiyan even stronger than Konya.
On the other side, other beylics.

118
00:19:45,366 --> 00:19:50,800
-You say our power isn't enough for our dreams?
-Boran Bey, you're right. But we know this.

119
00:19:53,366 --> 00:19:58,680
-The less have can still win against the more.
-Konur Bey, I see you.

120
00:20:00,126 --> 00:20:06,280
You're absolutely right.
But even if all of us gather...

121
00:20:07,406 --> 00:20:14,960
...we can recruit 10.000 horsemen at most.
Germiyan can gather 100.000 horsemen with a call.

122
00:20:16,566 --> 00:20:19,920
Karesi is about to capture Constantinople
with their ships.

123
00:20:21,326 --> 00:20:27,480
Karaman, right beside Konya,
is waiting for their prey to fall down.

124
00:20:31,526 --> 00:20:35,880
Tell me, Bayindir Bey.
What should we do?

125
00:20:39,926 --> 00:20:46,640
My Bey, we should ally with Germiyan.

126
00:20:48,166 --> 00:20:51,920
Even... Forgive me, my Bey, but...

127
00:20:53,966 --> 00:20:57,560
-We should enter Germiyan's service.
-Stop there.

128
00:20:59,126 --> 00:21:02,600
-What are you saying, Bayindir Bey?
-Konur Bey.

129
00:21:04,286 --> 00:21:09,120
Many states and beylics have got
destroyed like untimely dreams.

130
00:21:10,126 --> 00:21:13,560
I thought we agreed before.
But what about entering someone's service?

131
00:21:14,366 --> 00:21:18,420
Beys, this is the council of advice.

132
00:21:19,366 --> 00:21:21,920
Everyone can express their opinions here.

133
00:21:23,566 --> 00:21:27,000
Just let his words come out of his mouth.

134
00:21:29,686 --> 00:21:31,480
Speak, Bayindir Bey.

135
00:21:36,246 --> 00:21:40,940
Alps, tell stablemen to prepare
the horses of shahzades(princes).

136
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:42,770
As you order, Malhun Hatun.

137
00:21:44,486 --> 00:21:49,000
-Tell the ones in the soup kitchen to prepare food.
-As you order, Malhun Hatun.

138
00:21:50,726 --> 00:21:54,410
Mother, what is this preparation for
before the council is over.

139
00:21:54,410 --> 00:21:55,970
Did father give an order?

140
00:21:56,886 --> 00:22:02,460
No need for an order for this, daugter.
I'm his wife for years. I know your father well.

141
00:22:03,606 --> 00:22:07,790
-As far as I know, it will be a long day.
-Malhun Hatun.

142
00:22:08,726 --> 00:22:11,350
Shall I stop the preparations
for circumcision feast?

143
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:12,350
Don't, Ulgen.

144
00:22:12,566 --> 00:22:16,280
Osman Bey considers it very important.
Continue the preparations.

145
00:22:22,926 --> 00:22:24,360
Orhan Bey.

146
00:22:27,348 --> 00:22:28,828
Alaaddin Bey.

147
00:22:36,926 --> 00:22:41,860
I believe that my Bey is
the most powerful, the bravest...

148
00:22:42,210 --> 00:22:44,570
...and the most self-sacrificing
among the beys.

149
00:22:46,326 --> 00:22:52,640
If we, as his people, are worthy of
carrying his dreams to the far lands.

150
00:22:55,726 --> 00:22:59,180
The sun of our nation will rise
in these lands, I hope.

151
00:22:59,233 --> 00:23:01,383
I hope so. I hope so.

152
00:23:01,526 --> 00:23:03,520
I hope so.

153
00:23:05,846 --> 00:23:08,400
Now you speak, Orhan Bey.

154
00:23:09,926 --> 00:23:14,360
We are the ones at the frontiers.
We are in the borders of the enemy.

155
00:23:15,846 --> 00:23:19,390
Let the Anatolian Bey fight for the throne.

156
00:23:21,046 --> 00:23:26,880
As long as we fight the heathens,
the men leaving the throne fight will join us.

157
00:23:29,886 --> 00:23:34,650
Whether we go for the throne or not,
the conditions will push us to it.

158
00:23:34,650 --> 00:23:37,500
Because we are the fighting ones.

159
00:23:40,046 --> 00:23:41,800
Thank you.

160
00:23:46,566 --> 00:23:50,160
My fellows. My brothers.

161
00:23:51,806 --> 00:23:53,120
From the day...

162
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:57,710
when we buried my ancestor Suleyman Shah
in the wild water of Euphrates to this day,

163
00:23:58,686 --> 00:24:01,840
...we have left no lands untouched
by our horses!

164
00:24:04,526 --> 00:24:12,720
We were just a few before.
But we defeated many cruel ones!

165
00:24:15,366 --> 00:24:19,600
We saw that capturing is easy.

166
00:24:21,966 --> 00:24:26,800
But keeping...
Keeping it is the hardest.

167
00:24:29,646 --> 00:24:36,800
Well, the Great Seljuks...
They collapsed in front of our eyes.

168
00:24:38,726 --> 00:24:45,920
If only our state were strong and
we didn't have to talk about this today.

169
00:24:47,646 --> 00:24:50,400
But we have to talk now.

170
00:24:52,726 --> 00:24:58,240
For this reason,
both the fight and the feast will be ours.

171
00:25:01,486 --> 00:25:08,560
See, hear and protect.
A new age has begun.

172
00:25:09,806 --> 00:25:15,360
It will be hard,
but the new age will be ours.

173
00:25:17,886 --> 00:25:26,680
The arrow is already off the bow.
The struggle to pick the Sultan of Turks has begun.

174
00:25:27,886 --> 00:25:32,543
We will fight the cruel.

175
00:25:32,543 --> 00:25:37,200
But if beys bring up troubles,
we will fight them too.

176
00:25:42,726 --> 00:25:47,040
Alaaddin, arrive in Konya before the night.

177
00:25:48,206 --> 00:25:53,760
-Hear Sultan Mesud. He'll give you the relics.
-As my Bey orders.

178
00:25:55,446 --> 00:25:59,640
Orhan, there are some roving raiders
in the border of Byzantine.

179
00:26:00,726 --> 00:26:05,360
This troubled times can bear no chaos.
Draw them to our side.

180
00:26:06,566 --> 00:26:08,920
As my Bey orders.

181
00:26:10,126 --> 00:26:13,000
-Boran. Tell Beys.
-My Bey.

182
00:26:14,046 --> 00:26:17,560
I'll declare my decision at the feast in two days.

183
00:26:18,886 --> 00:26:22,200
-As you order, my Bey.
-There is no going back.

184
00:26:23,526 --> 00:26:26,200
The campaign is ours
and the victory belongs to Allah!

185
00:26:46,606 --> 00:26:50,680
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too, my Bey. Welcome.

186
00:27:03,806 --> 00:27:07,800
Praise be. It's a great molasses.

187
00:27:11,086 --> 00:27:15,880
-It's boiled perfectly.
-Enjoy it, my Bey.

188
00:27:17,366 --> 00:27:21,680
-Give some to the guests while opening the market.
-As you order, my Bey.

189
00:27:53,886 --> 00:28:00,920
This frontier market that I'm building
will be the best market in these lands.

190
00:28:04,326 --> 00:28:08,560
The poor and the rich...
All people will make us of it, if Allah permits.

191
00:28:09,766 --> 00:28:11,720
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

192
00:28:13,246 --> 00:28:18,040
Father, we've built the market with Allah's will.
You think everyone will come?

193
00:28:19,686 --> 00:28:25,120
If you are asking about the beys,
they are all our kin, my daughter.

194
00:28:26,206 --> 00:28:29,160
If you mean Osman Bey,

195
00:28:31,406 --> 00:28:40,960
He will come too. Because the real purpose
of this market is to unite us.

196
00:28:49,126 --> 00:28:53,960
-Father! Ambush!
-Alps! Stand on alert!

197
00:29:02,846 --> 00:29:04,960
-Are you alright?
-I'm good.

198
00:30:15,566 --> 00:30:18,840
There is Kayi seal on it.

199
00:30:22,526 --> 00:30:27,840
-Osman did this! He'll pay for this!
-Give it to me.

200
00:30:35,486 --> 00:30:37,160
Don't judge too quickly.

201
00:30:54,406 --> 00:30:56,690
Osman did this, father!

202
00:30:57,978 --> 00:31:00,318
Why would Osman do this?

203
00:31:00,332 --> 00:31:03,312
What would he gain on my death?

204
00:31:05,406 --> 00:31:10,200
My Bey, we got a message from Konya.
Sultan Mesud got poisoned.

205
00:31:18,366 --> 00:31:23,720
-Now I've got my answer, Osman.
-What's going on, my Bey?

206
00:31:26,766 --> 00:31:29,300
They poisoned Sultan Mesud.

207
00:31:33,273 --> 00:31:34,893
Osman...

208
00:31:37,726 --> 00:31:42,400
You got informed that
Sultan would die before I did.

209
00:31:44,886 --> 00:31:47,000
So you tried to eliminate me, huh?

210
00:31:48,686 --> 00:31:53,800
-My Bey, let me go to Yenisehir and destroy him.
-Never!

211
00:31:59,806 --> 00:32:05,880
An open attack against someone
doing things secretly isn't clever.

212
00:32:11,726 --> 00:32:20,080
I will make him pay for this.
But nobody will know about this ambush!

213
00:32:23,726 --> 00:32:28,160
-Now hear me well! Gonca.
-My Bey.

214
00:32:29,406 --> 00:32:32,280
Reach Konya before Sultan dies.

215
00:32:33,646 --> 00:32:37,680
Make him seal a firman proving
that we are the true successor.

216
00:32:38,620 --> 00:32:40,880
As my Bey father says.

217
00:32:42,526 --> 00:32:43,590
Mehmet!

218
00:32:44,683 --> 00:32:50,083
Osman who tried to hit us
must have sent messengers to gather beys.

219
00:32:50,374 --> 00:32:52,594
Cross the way of those messengers!

220
00:32:53,366 --> 00:32:58,360
-I want those beys with me!
-As my Bey father says.

221
00:33:00,166 --> 00:33:02,810
Never hesitate on your missions.

222
00:33:05,858 --> 00:33:10,798
If the soil craves blood, shed the blood!

223
00:33:19,966 --> 00:33:23,040
-Inform Mehmus.
-As you order, my Bey.

224
00:33:35,126 --> 00:33:41,120
Osman shot the first arrow. Now it's my turn.

225
00:33:47,326 --> 00:33:49,860
Give me your blessings, Mother Malhun.

226
00:33:50,753 --> 00:33:52,793
-You have it, my valiant.

227
00:33:55,286 --> 00:33:59,080
Fatma told me that
you had a nightmare again.

228
00:34:01,206 --> 00:34:08,440
Don't be sad, son. These days will be over too.
I sent a message to Sogut. Don't worry, alright?

229
00:34:09,806 --> 00:34:12,639
-Thanks, mother.
-My mother.

230
00:34:14,485 --> 00:34:20,639
-Give me your blessings.
-You have it, my lion.

231
00:34:24,525 --> 00:34:31,880
Your mother is always here. Remember.
You boys have a safe journey. I'll pray for you.

232
00:34:33,166 --> 00:34:35,480
-May Allah protect you.
-If Allah permits.

233
00:34:37,206 --> 00:34:40,400
Ulgen prepared the food.
Don't forget to take it.

234
00:34:42,366 --> 00:34:47,080
-Don't keep your father waiting. Come on.
-Son!.

235
00:34:48,525 --> 00:34:52,520
-My Bey.
-My Orhan!

236
00:34:55,126 --> 00:34:56,240
Praise be!

237
00:34:58,533 --> 00:34:59,533
Son.

238
00:35:00,886 --> 00:35:04,440
-May you have an open road and open eyes.
-Thank you, my father.

239
00:35:06,126 --> 00:35:11,880
Taking The Bannerless to your side
will be tough. But I trust you.

240
00:35:13,086 --> 00:35:16,180
With Allah's will, we'll be victorious.

241
00:35:16,453 --> 00:35:17,453
We will.

242
00:35:19,309 --> 00:35:20,979
My Alaaddin Ali.

243
00:35:24,326 --> 00:35:27,650
My dear son.
Come here.

244
00:35:30,326 --> 00:35:36,120
They put fire in Konya.
We don't know who is on whose side. Be cautious.

245
00:35:37,166 --> 00:35:43,200
-Okay, father.
-Use this for entrance.

246
00:35:46,046 --> 00:35:49,710
-Have a safe journey.
-Don't be worrying about me, dear father.

247
00:35:50,126 --> 00:35:53,480
-I will do what's necessary.
-Thank you.

248
00:35:55,326 --> 00:35:56,110
Come on.

249
00:35:56,766 --> 00:35:59,080
-Well, brother.
-Brother.

250
00:36:02,406 --> 00:36:04,960
May we have a safe journey.

251
00:36:07,206 --> 00:36:09,920
-Come on.
-If Allah permits, brother. Come on.

252
00:36:11,206 --> 00:36:12,930
Take care, sons.

253
00:36:13,728 --> 00:36:18,548
Brothers, where are you going
without seeing me?

254
00:36:24,326 --> 00:36:30,240
I am sending you alone now.
But in your next duty, I'll come with you!

255
00:36:31,486 --> 00:36:36,400
-We are looking forward to that day, my sister.
-Don't I deserve it, my Bey father?

256
00:36:37,526 --> 00:36:43,120
No... You have to defeat me in the training.
Then you can go.

257
00:36:44,286 --> 00:36:48,460
Then when I come back,
we should exercise more, my sister.

258
00:36:48,613 --> 00:36:51,043
Go fast, and come back fast, my brothers.

259
00:36:51,926 --> 00:36:53,130
Come here...

260
00:37:01,486 --> 00:37:02,570
Well...

261
00:37:04,618 --> 00:37:05,618
Let's go.

262
00:37:08,266 --> 00:37:11,220
Oi, oi.
Let's go, Malhun.

263
00:37:15,986 --> 00:37:17,390
Malhun?

264
00:37:19,886 --> 00:37:23,450
Why are you crying? Our valiants grew up.
They can take care of themselves now.

265
00:37:24,618 --> 00:37:27,528
Regardless of that,
I cannot control my heart, my Bey.

266
00:37:31,316 --> 00:37:33,080
Come on, wipe your tears.

267
00:37:35,283 --> 00:37:38,843
They are both brave men,
they will come back soon.

268
00:37:39,486 --> 00:37:40,920
If Allah permits.

269
00:37:43,503 --> 00:37:45,753
Let's go, let's go.

270
00:38:27,206 --> 00:38:31,240
-May it heal you.
-I had a dream.

271
00:38:32,526 --> 00:38:34,040
May it be good.

272
00:38:40,206 --> 00:38:41,810
In my dream...

273
00:38:48,726 --> 00:38:51,110
...I was digging my Halime's grave.

274
00:39:00,486 --> 00:39:02,810
Then Alaeddin came.

275
00:39:05,373 --> 00:39:07,643
. I was dead, Kismet.

276
00:39:15,206 --> 00:39:21,440
-Maybe the time has come, huh?
-How can you say that? May Allah protect you.

277
00:39:22,726 --> 00:39:30,120
Besides, dreams never show the truth, they say.
Shahzade Alaeddin might need you now.

278
00:39:41,806 --> 00:39:43,690
Do you think so?

279
00:39:49,086 --> 00:39:53,410
You have to heal, Bala Hatun.
You have to heal for our Shahzade.

280
00:39:54,428 --> 00:39:58,398
Look, your son is doing his best
to heal you.

281
00:40:03,406 --> 00:40:07,780
Can I come in, Bala Hatun?
Something came from Yenisehir.

282
00:40:08,013 --> 00:40:10,043
-Let her come.
-Come in.

283
00:40:13,166 --> 00:40:14,820
May it be good, Inshallah.

284
00:40:20,246 --> 00:40:25,560
Bala Hatun. Malhun Hatun sent this for you.
Healers in Yenisehir prepared it.

285
00:40:26,966 --> 00:40:30,360
Thank her.

286
00:40:32,326 --> 00:40:37,160
Tell me. How are things in the palace?
Osman, Alaeddin, Orhan?

287
00:40:38,286 --> 00:40:40,480
-How are they?
-They are all good.

288
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:43,580
Shahzade(Prince) Alaeddin
went to Konya for a duty.

289
00:40:44,166 --> 00:40:47,060
Sultan Mesud was poisoned.
They say he cannot recover.

290
00:40:49,413 --> 00:40:51,043
Allah forbid...

291
00:40:52,876 --> 00:40:54,460
Too much blood will be shed.

292
00:40:57,073 --> 00:40:58,073
Too much blood.

293
00:41:09,809 --> 00:41:18,339
Please contact us for any inquiries: turkision@gmail.com

294
00:41:23,166 --> 00:41:24,980
Stay on alert!

295
00:41:26,183 --> 00:41:31,313
We've fought many fights!
But the Bannerless are different!

296
00:41:32,646 --> 00:41:35,870
Some of them are thieves,
some of them are murderers.

297
00:41:36,003 --> 00:41:39,083
There are even those
who kill their own ancestors.

298
00:41:39,166 --> 00:41:41,080
They don't show mercy to anyone!

299
00:41:41,283 --> 00:41:44,643
Those leaderless people haven't seen you yet,
my Shahzade(Prince)

300
00:41:44,846 --> 00:41:49,420
Those who kill their own fathers do not care
about anyone, Dark Ali. We have to be cautious.

301
00:41:50,286 --> 00:41:53,950
They only care about each other.

302
00:41:55,086 --> 00:42:04,400
Our duty is to stop them.
We will do what is necessary.

303
00:42:11,406 --> 00:42:15,240
-Cerkutay! Cerkutay!
-They are going to cut me!

304
00:42:16,366 --> 00:42:21,840
Sisters! Catch him! Cerkutay! Cerkutay!
Cerkutay come here!

305
00:42:23,166 --> 00:42:27,240
If this Hatun catches me,
bad things will happen! Help me!

306
00:42:28,726 --> 00:42:34,560
You little coward! Come here! I wonder
what Osman Bey would say if he saw you here!

307
00:42:35,766 --> 00:42:38,720
My name is Cerkutay!
I am scared of nothing!

308
00:42:39,523 --> 00:42:44,033
-Do you know Osman Bey? I want to talk to him.

309
00:42:48,846 --> 00:42:54,600
Osman Bey, huh?
Everyone knows him here.

310
00:42:55,806 --> 00:43:00,280
But be careful... Osman Bey is an angry man.

311
00:43:01,446 --> 00:43:09,810
When you are talking to him, you have to
choose your words wisely. Or else...

312
00:43:12,046 --> 00:43:16,600
-I have never heard that about him.
-Sure you haven't.

313
00:43:16,833 --> 00:43:20,263
Those who witnessed
his anger never survived.

314
00:43:23,206 --> 00:43:25,160
Protect your head.

315
00:43:30,766 --> 00:43:36,800
Come on, you will be circumcised.
Sisters, take him. Cerkutay! -Let me go!

316
00:43:38,366 --> 00:43:47,510
Let go off me!
I will not be circumcised! Fatma Hatun!

317
00:43:52,126 --> 00:44:02,560
You will go to Osman when the time comes.
This is Cerkutay's amulet. You'll give it to him.

318
00:44:08,886 --> 00:44:18,040
There's a feast in the hall.
There's nothing missing. The hungry ones are eating.

319
00:44:19,206 --> 00:44:27,240
-Praise be, Praise be.
-People rejoiced when they heard you will join too.

320
00:44:28,446 --> 00:44:31,000
As if everyone was waiting for this news.

321
00:44:32,366 --> 00:44:40,240
We would want to make them happy with conquest,
but it was not destined to be for now.

322
00:44:41,486 --> 00:44:47,000
Let's go to the ceremony
and let's comfort them a little.

323
00:44:48,126 --> 00:44:54,200
If I wasn't here, you'd be leading the ceremony.
You wouldn't make them feel that I was missing.

324
00:44:55,326 --> 00:45:00,080
-It wouldn't be the same.
-Of course not, you are my beautiful Hatun.

325
00:45:01,326 --> 00:45:06,840
The sacrifices you have made so far
are countless.

326
00:45:08,166 --> 00:45:15,840
You're not only the mother of my children,
you are the mother of the whole Kayi, thank you.

327
00:45:16,686 --> 00:45:26,230
I was a daughter of a Bey. Now I'm the Hatun
of Osman Bey who will establish the holy state.

328
00:45:26,846 --> 00:45:31,820
I'm ready to do whatever it takes,
and I will be so until my last breath.

329
00:45:32,646 --> 00:45:39,080
See? That is why wherever I go,
I will not be worried.

330
00:46:00,446 --> 00:46:05,190
Alps! Ambush! Get ready!

331
00:46:34,126 --> 00:46:39,000
Allah is the Greatest.

332
00:46:50,206 --> 00:46:55,560
-He is a tough fighter.
-I've seen many tough fighters.

333
00:46:58,926 --> 00:47:01,810
I'll make him ask for mercy.

334
00:48:06,526 --> 00:48:08,410
Ask for mercy.

335
00:48:09,458 --> 00:48:12,048
Not before I die.

336
00:49:08,526 --> 00:49:14,040
-Who are you? What are you looking for?
-I want to see your leader.

337
00:49:17,326 --> 00:49:22,760
We don't have any leader,
we are united.

338
00:49:24,006 --> 00:49:31,180
-Tell me your name.
-I'm Orhan Bey, son of Osman Bey.

339
00:49:43,566 --> 00:49:52,960
You are the son of a Bey, is that so?
Your position is useless here, son of a Bey!

340
00:49:54,206 --> 00:50:00,000
What does it take to enter, tell me.

341
00:50:01,246 --> 00:50:09,920
Leave your Bey sword and position,
then you can enter through that door, son of Bey.

342
00:50:11,086 --> 00:50:18,280
Do you want the sword of a man
that you just ambushed?

343
00:50:22,966 --> 00:50:30,440
If you still determined despite the blood
that has been shed, your life is our trust, son of Bey.

344
00:50:31,726 --> 00:50:38,880
Abandon your position and sword
so that we can listen to your problem.

345
00:51:14,366 --> 00:51:17,760
I'm not going to be circumcised!
No!

346
00:51:18,926 --> 00:51:21,920
-Bring the fugitive!
-I will not!

347
00:51:23,006 --> 00:51:28,310
Don't wait like sacrificial lambs!
Run away! They will cut us all!

348
00:51:33,316 --> 00:51:34,630
Attention!

349
00:51:36,808 --> 00:51:38,098
Osman Bey!

350
00:51:51,966 --> 00:51:55,770
-Peace be upon you
-Peace be upon you too.

351
00:52:02,646 --> 00:52:05,840
-Save me my Bey!
-Cerkutay!

352
00:52:07,006 --> 00:52:14,400
Come here, Cerkutay.
Son, you don't need to be afraid.

353
00:52:15,566 --> 00:52:19,400
-I'll be your guardian.
-I'm not afraid of anything, my Bey.

354
00:52:20,646 --> 00:52:24,050
-Is that so?
-I'm waiting for my father.

355
00:52:24,193 --> 00:52:27,133
I don't want to be circumcised without him.

356
00:52:46,686 --> 00:52:48,090
Is that so?

357
00:52:51,978 --> 00:52:52,978
Then...

358
00:52:57,166 --> 00:53:00,770
Look at me. I promise you as a Bey.

359
00:53:04,006 --> 00:53:09,360
Let's postpone your circumcision
until your father arrives.

360
00:53:09,693 --> 00:53:11,173
-Really, my Bey?

361
00:53:11,246 --> 00:53:13,700
-Yes.
-Thank you Osman Bey!

362
00:53:25,806 --> 00:53:31,480
Look here. Brave boy.

363
00:53:32,646 --> 00:53:36,320
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

364
00:53:37,406 --> 00:53:43,320
-Long live Osman Bey!
-Astagfirullah. Thank you.

365
00:53:44,686 --> 00:53:54,200
Come here. We will mount, draw swords
and we will conquer many lands together.

366
00:53:55,286 --> 00:53:57,060
-If Allah permits, my Bey!

367
00:53:58,523 --> 00:54:01,143
However, in order not to
stumble on our way...

368
00:54:04,326 --> 00:54:07,510
...we need to have the
morals of Prophet.

369
00:54:08,738 --> 00:54:10,198
We will not stop.

370
00:54:11,326 --> 00:54:20,560
We will not let our sweat go cold.
If we walk our path with faith,

371
00:54:21,646 --> 00:54:27,600
then you will see that our Creator
will expand our way.

372
00:54:29,046 --> 00:54:34,280
-Tell me now, will you walk with me?
-We will, my Bey!

373
00:54:35,366 --> 00:54:39,000
-Will you walk with me?
-We will my Bey!

374
00:54:40,086 --> 00:54:42,040
Praise be, praise be!

375
00:54:43,966 --> 00:54:49,440
Thanks to my Mighty Creator
for making me a Bey of a people like you.

376
00:54:50,726 --> 00:54:53,560
May my Creator make you
the Bey of all the ummah.

377
00:54:54,806 --> 00:54:58,080
-May Allah keep you with us Osman Bey!
-Long live Osman Bey!

378
00:54:59,246 --> 00:55:02,760
-Long live Osman Bey!
-Long live Osman Bey!

379
00:55:03,766 --> 00:55:08,760
Thank you. Come on then,
let's start the ceremony.

380
00:55:19,686 --> 00:55:25,730
Come on, let our soul be rejoiced.
Boran.

381
00:55:26,066 --> 00:55:29,590
-Yes, my Bey.
-Let the words come out.

382
00:55:30,688 --> 00:55:31,688
As you order, my Bey.

383
